{"schemaVersion":3,"id":"62663d3a-69ca-4557-8340-e0e7ad343a17","title":"你好，我喝醉了，想借着醉意表白，合适嘛？","createdAt":1742666627757,"updatedAt":1742666704641,"messages":[{"role":"user","content":{"root":{"children":[{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你好，我喝醉了，想借着醉意表白，合适嘛？","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""}],"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"type":"root","version":1}},"promptContent":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\n你好，我喝醉了，想借着醉意表白，合适嘛？\n\n"}],"id":"b900de92-8a58-4f52-8654-8ca0a4c3affd","mentionables":[{"type":"current-file","file":null}]},{"role":"assistant","content":"```markdown\n## 醉后表白的利弊分析\n\n### 短期内看：\n✅ **放松胆怯**：酒精可能暂时降低焦虑感，更容易开口  \n⚠️ **风险高**：  \n1. 语言组织混乱，重要心意表达不完整  \n2. 决策判断力下降（可能说不该说的话）  \n3. 第二天清醒后存在「表白撤回困境」\n\n### 长期影响：\n🗃️ **记忆锚定效应**：对方未来回忆起表白场景会是醉酒状态  \n❤️🩹 若失败：后续关系修复比清醒时更困难  \n\n### 替代方案：\n1️⃣ **即时方案**：用手机录音功能把醉话存下来，明天回听再决定  \n2️⃣ **进阶方案**：写封信（手写/备忘录），24小时后再检查发送  \n3️⃣ **保险方案**：现在设个闹钟，标题写\"向XX表白的清醒时刻\"，明天固定时间段处理\n```\n\n需要修改告白的文字措辞模板可以告诉我，建议避免在血清素和γ-氨基丁酸失衡时做重大情感决策。","id":"d5f52f0f-59ce-4c08-a0c9-3833e7b4edce","metadata":{"usage":{"prompt_tokens":416,"completion_tokens":410,"total_tokens":826,"cost":0,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":306}},"model":{"providerType":"openrouter","providerId":"openrouter","id":"ds-r1","model":"deepseek/deepseek-r1:free"}}},{"role":"user","content":{"root":{"children":[{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"你好，我喝醉了，想借着醉意表白，合适嘛？","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""}],"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"type":"root","version":1}},"promptContent":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\n你好，我喝醉了，想借着醉意表白，合适嘛？\n\n"}],"id":"3f26f678-6b85-4026-a4b9-a4dc1a6acfe2","mentionables":[{"type":"current-file","file":null}]},{"role":"assistant",